# Grass rolls slow: on a flat lawn in the city (element type park: ground.rollingByType.park, Crr
# 0.12) a board pushed to 5 m/s loses about 1.24 m/s per second and stops after 4.1 s, 10 m on.
# On road (Crr 0.018) the same push loses 0.23 m/s per second and would roll on for about 60 m.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 108.0 322 2.50 0   # the flat lawn of Civic Center Plaza
cmd 20 speed 5
run 600
expect skater.speed > 3.85 at 120
expect skater.speed < 4.05 at 120
expect skater.speed < 0.1 at 520
expect skater.speed > 1.45 at 360   # (this lawn rises 0.2% northward)
expect skater.pos.y > 331.5 at 600
expect skater.pos.y < 332.6 at 600
expect no event bail
